      }
    },
    "This Apple TV app works fully offline with bundled content and has no accounts, analytics, telemetry, ads, networking code, iCloud sync, push notifications, remote config, or third-party SDKs. Practice sessions are kept only while the app is open; nothing is saved or sent." : {
